{
  "_comment": "Junior overlay \u2014 opencode v2 ORDERED rules, last match wins; self-contained (org floor at the END, nothing above can unlock it). Safety net against accidents, not a security boundary. v2 gates file READS too \u2014 juniors get explicit read-tier allows so browsing never prompts. v2 bonus: session snapshots + /revert make mistakes cheaply reversible.",
